WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.500
09:30 — Quick check-in. Between classes Hamza opens Today on his phone — he missed yesterday during a midterm, and the screen does not turn red or lecture him about streaks.

00:00:08.500 --> 00:00:17.000
15:00 — Learn something small. On the hostel iPad he reads a short Knowledge card about sleep debt, bookmarks nothing flashy, just something he can try tonight without buying a course.

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:25.500
20:15 — Study laptop, SOS ready. His study laptop stays open to SOS while he revises; roommate is the contact. Knowing the button exists is half the calm.

00:00:25.500 --> 00:00:34.000
23:40 — One line journal. In bed he writes one honest sentence on the phone journal — exam dread, not a performance — then locks the screen.

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:42.500
00:10 — Close the day. He puts the phone face-down. The app does not nag him for a second check-in or a perfect week.

